@XuePing.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5242
@token = 粘贴登录接口返回的 token

### 1. 获取验证码（开发模式直接返回验证码）
POST {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/User/code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001"
}

### 2. 登录，拿到 token（填到上面的 @token）
POST {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/User/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 3. 课程列表
GET {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Course
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 课程详情（逻辑过期缓存）
GET {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Course/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 课程 UV（HyperLogLog）
GET {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Course/1/uv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 课程评价列表
GET {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Review/course/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 抢课名额
POST {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/CourseSelection/quota/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 抢课（Lua 原子扣减 + 入队，返回排队中）
POST {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/CourseSelection/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 抢课结果轮询
GET {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/CourseSelection/status/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 签到状态（Bitmap）
GET {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Sign/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 关注动态 Feed
GET {{XuePing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Feed?count=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
